{"name":"Limetta","hex":"#8e9a21","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"limetta","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Citrus limetta, a small, round, sweet citrus fruit, a cross between the citron and bitter orange."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/limetta"}],"entries":[{"title":"Citrus limetta","blocks":[{"text":"Citrus limetta, alternatively considered to be a cultivar of Citrus limon, C. limon 'Limetta', is a species of citrus, commonly known as mousami, musami, mosambi, sweet lime, sweet lemon, and sweet limetta, it is a member of the sweet lemons. It is small and round, like a common lime. It is a cross between the citron and a bitter orange."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d6/Citrus_limetta.jpeg/330px-Citrus_limetta.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Citrus_limetta","wikidata":"Q2405517"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7a/%28Citrus_limetta%29_Mosambi_at_a_market_in_Seethammadhara.jpg/500px-%28Citrus_limetta%29_Mosambi_at_a_market_in_Seethammadhara.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7a/%28Citrus_limetta%29_Mosambi_at_a_market_in_Seethammadhara.jpg/1280px-%28Citrus_limetta%29_Mosambi_at_a_market_in_Seethammadhara.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7a/%28Citrus_limetta%29_Mosambi_at_a_market_in_Seethammadhara.jpg/500px-%28Citrus_limetta%29_Mosambi_at_a_market_in_Seethammadhara.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The limetta (lemetjie), Mosambi cultivar, at a market in Seethammadhara.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3A(Citrus_limetta)_Mosambi_at_a_market_in_Seethammadhara.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.o